               ADOLESCENTs FULL COLOR ANSI MENUs for CNet/3


iNFO
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
This is simply a replacement full screen IBM/ANSI menu set that I use over
at IllCommunication and most people like.  All ANSI was done by myself and
is (C)1995.  Please do not rip these cause I took a long time to make them
and I would probably cry if I saw them (or pieces of them) in other people
programs...


iNSTALL
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Very simple, just copy the entire MENU dir to SYSTEXT:MENU/...   I suggest
using a program similar to NAB/X to switch between the Novice/Expert level
to switch between the menu types.

Included are original CNet/3 menus (with a color change...) that have been
modified to work with this setup.  (the line on the top checks to see what
help level the user is and chooses the propper menu.


